# Line endings are normalized to LF in the repository and checked out as LF on every
# platform. Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true can commit a whole
# file as CRLF (it happened to packages/state/src/scan/processScanDeclaration.ts in 3.2:
# a 3-line change landed as a 951-line diff and flattened `git blame` for the file).
# `text=auto` still leaves binary files alone — git detects them.
* text=auto eol=lf
